{"type":"text","timestamp":1794527702766,"sessionID":"ses_e2dd82e01ffeqmnJRIxBdI7fut","part":{"id":"prt_1d22f9edc001BSkZ3rURbo98kr","sessionID":"ses_e2dd82e01ffeqmnJRIxBdI7fut","messageID":"msg_1d22f80c10013wE0VjDz81Rqe3","type":"text","text":"T007 is complete. Two files were created and every part of the task's Verify passed.\n\n**Files written**\n- `.skilled/commands/doctor/scripts/codex-hook-approval-check.cjs`\n- `.skilled/commands/doctor/scripts/tests/codex-hook-approval-check.test.cjs`\n\nThe check reads `<root>/.codex/hooks.json`, derives the advisor hook's group and index, then looks for the matching `[hooks.state.\"...\"]` block with a `trusted_hash` before the next header. It tries the root as given and as its real path. Outputs are `SKIP no-codex-hooks` (0), `WARN codex-advisor-hook-absent` (1), `PASS codex-hooks-approved` (0) and `WARN codex-hooks-unapproved <root>` plus the repair line (1). Bad flags exit 2. It only reads.\n\n**Verify output**\n\n`node --test .skilled/commands/doctor/scripts/tests/codex-hook-approval-check.test.cjs`\n```\n✔ an approved advisor entry passes (25.762625ms)\n✔ an entry with no approval warns and names the repair (24.498708ms)\n✔ a project without .codex is skipped (23.311375ms)\nℹ tests 3\nℹ suites 0\nℹ pass 3\nℹ fail 0\n```\n\n`rg -n \"writeFile|appendFile|mkdir|rename|rmSync|unlink\" .skilled/commands/doctor/scripts/codex-hook-approval-check.cjs`\n```\n(no output, exit 1)\n```\n\n`shasum -a 256 ~/.codex/config.toml` before and after `node .skilled/commands/doctor/scripts/codex-hook-approval-check.cjs --root .`\n```\nBEFORE:2efe319688554edec909307be806e6e88eac1f18ed4ccbced54111e636ea4e20\nWARN codex-hooks-unapproved .\nrepair: open /hooks in a Codex session at . and approve each entry\nCHECK_EXIT:1\nAFTER:2efe319688554edec909307be806e6e88eac1f18ed4ccbced54111e636ea4e20\nDIGEST_IDENTICAL\n```\n\nThe WARN is the designed verdict for this worktree: its `.codex/hooks.json` has the advisor hook at group 0 index 0, but the home config has no `hooks.state` entry for this checkout's path. `git status` shows only the two new untracked files from this task.\n\nNothing could not be done. The `T007` checkbox in `tasks.md` is left unticked as instructed, and no operator action is needed for this task.","time":{"start":1794527698652,"end":1794527702766}}}
